   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "欢迎大型储物家具",
   "texts": [
    "/rooms/living-room/how-to/dao4-di3-neng2-zhuang1-xia4-duo1-shao3-wu4-pin3-shi4-he2-xiao3-kong1-jian1-de-chu3-wu4-chuang4-yi4-pubc11ba230",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Frooms%2Fliving-room%2Fhow-to%2Fdao4-di3-neng2-zhuang1-xia4-duo1-shao3-wu4-pin3-shi4-he2-xiao3-kong1-jian1-de-chu3-wu4-chuang4-yi4-pubc11ba230&key=cn--zh--c11ba230c53e11eb929fff34060b2457",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/rooms/living-room/how-to/dao4-di3-neng2-zhuang1-xia4-duo1-shao3-wu4-pin3-shi4-he2-xiao3-kong1-jian1-de-chu3-wu4-chuang4-yi4-pubc11ba230\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "是的，即使家中空间很小，也可以选择更大的家具，而不必担心挤占家里的空间，下面我们来看看如何做到这一点。宽敞的PAX 帕克思 衣柜单元颜色与墙面颜色相匹配，衣柜组合几乎融入了房间本身。搭配抽屉、挂杆、KOMPLEMENT 康普蒙 储物盒和衣架，打造时尚人士梦想中的衣柜，将一切收纳妥当，连一只袜子也不落下。",
    "欢迎大型储物家具"
   ],
